#Задача_implement_graph_canvas_svg_edge_overlay<[
Базис:
  Источник: analytics:graph-edges-n8n-parity (AN-5), C2–C3.
  Overlay под flow-canvas (z-index), синхронизировать viewport via FlowInstance.subscribe.
Вектор:
  graphCanvasSvgEdges.ts: mount/unmount/repaint, marker-end arrows, edge labels.
